l_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1--plan","local_name":"sase-168.1--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-168","agent_clan_generation":"20260922100710","agent_family":"sase-168.1","agent_family_role":"plan","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-168.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-168[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Make remote-attention notifications dismissable and unfreeze [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]apollo's attention feed[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]A user dismissal of a remote-attention notification sticks for that[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]revision; the gateway attention inventory works on hosts with more [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]than 200 visible notifications; and on athena the fix is installed,[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the 8 stuck apollo rows are dismissed and stay dismissed, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fresh sase screenshot no longer shows `?8` at the top right.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]remote_attention_dismissal_fix.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/remote_attention_dismissal_fix.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-168[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-168/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Honor local dismissal in the remote-attention reconciler[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]inbox-dismissal[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inbox-dismissal: stop reconcile_remote_attention_inbox from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]un-dismissing same-revision rows, mark and reverse only its own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]auto-dismissals, and treat has_more pages as incomplete, with regression[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gateway attention inventory must not fail on busy hosts[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]inventory-row-cap[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inventory-row-cap: in sase-core, drop the 200 raw-row cap from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project_fleet_attention_inventory (paging bounds output) and pre-filter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the gateway handler to actionable rows, with core and route tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install on athena, dismiss the 8 rows, and verify[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]deploy-dismiss-verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inbox-dismissal, inventory-row-cap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]deploy-dismiss-verify: run sase update -y, restart pre-update TUIs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through their Quit/Restart panel, dismiss the remote-attention rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm they stay dismissed, and verify via sase screenshot that ?8 is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gone.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-168","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-168.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-168.1"},"source_run_id":"run-e3637cc3b6670069b29a24c1f804ee2e","started_at":"2026-09-22T14:08:19.415324+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3ad9c3ff3b140f1b65e2c718b5aa7921715b4456fe982e53554955b2f